♪Yang berkumpul menjadi♪

540
00:43:20,321 --> 00:43:25,181
♪Rupamu♪

541
00:43:25,621 --> 00:43:28,151
♪Melihat ke atas♪

542
00:43:28,411 --> 00:43:32,181
♪Kemuliaan yang memesona♪

543
00:43:32,881 --> 00:43:35,451
♪Seperti harapan♪

544
00:43:35,631 --> 00:43:39,551
♪Merentangkan tangannya♪

545
00:43:40,191 --> 00:43:42,781
♪Berjubahkan cahaya♪

546
00:43:42,781 --> 00:43:47,181
♪Pergi sendirian pun berani♪

547
00:43:47,421 --> 00:43:49,881
♪Melewati♪

548
